        <mxCell id="dns-read-subtitle" parent="dns-read" vertex="1" value="Private Azure service lookup: client -&amp;gt; inbound resolver -&amp;gt; Azure DNS -&amp;gt; linked private zone -&amp;gt; private NIC address. Customer namespace lookup: Azure DNS -&amp;gt; matched ruleset -&amp;gt; outbound endpoint -&amp;gt; corporate DNS. A ruleset link can work&lt;br&gt;without peering, but direct DNS/IP traffic still needs a reachable network path." style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#B7C8DA;fontStyle=0;">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="2280" height="44" as="geometry" />
