        <mxCell id="dns-ha-subtitle" parent="dns-ha" vertex="1" value="Provide independently reachable regional resolver endpoints and zone links. Cross-region ruleset VNet links are not supported. Do not copy the example DNS failover lab&amp;#x27;s synthetic domains, upstream VMs, test addresses or NVA route&lt;br&gt;assumptions into OneGrid." style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#B7C8DA;fontStyle=0;">
