        <object id="logs" label="" tooltip="Container Apps environment -&gt; Log Analytics&#10;Environment logging is wired in Bicep. Job logs cycle/source/step count, candidate count, track count, publish location and failures.&#10;No storms + no regional export: skip the endpoint and publish an empty list. A failed run can leave the prior output file.">
