        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="weather-caveats-subtitle" parent="weather-caveats" vertex="1" value="20 x 6 h = 120 h from analysis time, not job wall-clock time. Gust = wind x 1.25; cone radius = 25 + 1.5 x lead-hours miles; confidence label uses track length. These are application rules, not calibrated ensemble probabilities or&lt;br&gt;customer-asset failure calculations." style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#B7C8DA;fontStyle=0;">
